	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et vitę innocentiam a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi in pre<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>terito mense octobri epistolam tuam, charissime <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>frater, <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> calendis septembris prioris anni scriptam<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief vom 1. September 1537 ist nicht erhalten.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in qua ais me tibi probe referre animum candidum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et talia nunctiare de <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemis</placeName> fratribus, que prorsus<pb type="edition" next="106"/> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>animum tuum exhilarabant.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quanto vicissim nos <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>gaudio simus perfusi inspectis tuis litteris, nolo ego <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>huius gaudii preconem agere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Per amanuensem<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Unbekannt.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>communicavi eam et d. <persName ref="p8127">Chonradi Pellicani</persName> epistolam<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p8127">Pellikans</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p2448">Pergener</persName> [vom 30. August 1537; vgl. Zürich ZB, Ms. F 47, 23r.] ist nicht erhalten.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>multis fratribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Idem fatio de confessione <persName ref="p4091">Hul[drici] Cz[vinglii]</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist die von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> 1536 herausgegebene "Fidei expositio" <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglis</persName> (<bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> VI/V 1-163).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sancte memorię viri, mihi dono missa, pro qua ago <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>gratias quam plurimas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Agnosco plane ex hac epis<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tola animum tuum vere vigilantem, sincerum, ferventem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ac indefessum in provehenda gloria Christi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Imo penitius eum deprehendo ex pientissimis comm<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>entariis tuis, quę in utilitatem reipublicae christianę <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>non sine celesti revelatione emisisti.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Primum nomen <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tuum ex libello De prophetę offitio<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 33.</note> mihi cognitum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>est<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. dazu <bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl> <ref target="file10303">[Nr. 272]</ref>, S. 204f, 13-23.</note>, ac mox Commentaria in acta apostolorum<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 43.</note> gratis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ac muneris loco misisti.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Adeptus sum vere au<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>reum libellum tuum De testamento seu fędere de<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>i unico et eterno<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 54.</note>, item commentaria in aepistolas <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ad Romanos<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 42.</note>, in utramque ad Corinthios<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 53 und 71.</note>, ad Galatas, Ephesios, Philippenses<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>, Colossenses,<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 72.</note> ad Tessalonicenses, Timotheum, Titum et Philemonem<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 81.</note>, ad <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Hebraeos<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 38.</note>, in divi Petri epistolas<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 52.</note>, item Assertionem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tuam orthodoxam utriusque nature in Christo tam <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>divinę quam humanę etc<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 62. - Die Aufzählung stimmt mit der im Brief vom 15. Februar 1537 angeführten Besitzliste überein; vgl. <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl> <ref target="file10991">[Nr. 949]</ref>, S. 64, 14-20.</note>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Haec omnia has aediculas, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quam diu spiravero, non exibunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ago deo nostro <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>gratias immortales, qui nobis suam sacratissimam <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>scripturam claram dignatus est fieri tuis laboribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Non arbitror necessarium ad omnes articulos, qui <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>in tua sunt epistola, respondere, et certe mire vererer <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>has meas impolitas litteras et plane barbaras ad t<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>antos viros mittere, nisi summa pietas vestra, quę <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>mihi iam aliquot annis ex scriptis vestris cognita est, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>hunc timorem ad vos scribendi abigeret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Fit mentio <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>libelli cuiusdam de providentia dei<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> VI/III 1-230.</note> divi <persName ref="p4091">Hul[drici] Tzving[lii]</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>in prefatione, quam <persName ref="p8171">Theodorus Bibliander</persName> prefixit quatuor<pb type="scan" next="13"/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>libris, in quibus continentur divine prorsus epistole <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p2442">Iohannis Oecolampadii</persName> et <persName ref="p4091">Hul[drici] Tzving[lii]</persName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p2442">Oekolampad</persName>-Bibliographie 88f, Nr. 182. - <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglis</persName> "De providentia dei" findet sich in der Vorrede erwähnt auf fol. ß4v.</note>, quem libellum utinam <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>liceret legere.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Alia quam plurima habeo, que doctissimi <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>illi viri scripserunt, libellum De genuina verborum <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>domini: hoc est corpus meum etc. interpretatione<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18"><persName ref="p2442">Oekolampad</persName>-Bibliographie 55, Nr. 113.</note>, unum <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et alterum ad <persName ref="p6109">Pirckheymerum</persName><note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> <persName ref="p6109">Pirckheymerun</persName>.</note><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><persName ref="p2442">Oekolampad</persName>-Bibliographie 62f, Nr. 131, und 66, <ref target="file10171">Nr. 140</ref>.</note>, In Hiobum<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><persName ref="p2442">Oekolampad</persName>-Bibliographie 81, Nr. 168.</note>, et multa <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>alia, Amicam exegesim<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21"><bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> V 548-758.</note>, De vera et falsa<pb type="edition" next="107"/> religione<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22"><bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> III 590-912.</note>, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>insuper in Esaiam<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">z XIV 1-412.</note>, Hieremiam<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24"><bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> XIV 413-681.</note>, disputationem <lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernensem</placeName><note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Gemeint ist einer der beiden im Jahre 1528 bei <persName ref="p4851">Froschauer</persName> erschienenen Drukke zur <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Disputation (vgl. <bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> VI/I 241f).</note>, responsionem ad confessionem <persName ref="p1974">Luth[eri]</persName><note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26">z VI/II 1-248.</note> g<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ermanice<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> germanicae.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Male me habet litteras meas, quas ad <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName ref="p467">Martinum Bucerum</persName> misi<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27">Vgl. <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl>, S. 75, 14f.</note>, ad vos non pervenisse.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Co<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>gitabimus de ratione, qua certus aliquando nunctius <lb xml:id="p2z13"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> veniat, neque tutum est incertis hominibus <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>in tam longinquam regionem committere litteras.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Epistolam tuam et <persName ref="p8127">Pellicani</persName><note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28">Vgl. oben Anm. 1 und 3.</note> una cum confessione<note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29">Vgl. oben Anm. 4.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z16"/><persName ref="p6053">uxoris</persName><note xml:id="fn30" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="30"><persName ref="p6053">Anna, geb. Engler</persName> (vgl. <hi>Seeliger,</hi> aaO, S. 43).</note> meę <persName ref="p4708">frater</persName><note xml:id="fn31" type="footnote" n="31"><persName ref="p4708">Tobias Engler</persName>, seit dem Sommersemester 1537 in <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberg</placeName> immatrikuliert (vgl. <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberg</placeName>, Matrikel I 165 und <hi>Seeliger,</hi> aaO, S. 38, Anm. 4).</note>, qui modo agit <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberge</placeName>, misit <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ad me nullis additis litteris.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Omnia tamen pulchre <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>erant obsignata.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Bis iam scripsi adfini meo, ut <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>saltem indicaret, a quo accepisset litteras, nam opus <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>esse responso.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Impetrare potui nihil.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Has litteras <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>tradidi cuidam<note xml:id="fn32" type="footnote" n="32"><persName ref="p304">Hans Becherer</persName>, Stadtarzt (vgl. unten Z. 47 und <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl> <ref target="file10997">[Nr. 955]</ref>, S. 76, 27 mit Anm. 10).</note> ex nostris fratribus, qui hic sunt, <lb xml:id="p2z22"/><placeName ref="l361">Norinbergam</placeName> perferendas, qui bona fide promisit sese cu<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>raturum, ut illinc per socerum suum<note xml:id="fn33" type="footnote" n="33">Unbekannt.</note> <placeName ref="l157">Francfordium</placeName> per<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>veniant; nam is frater, huius urbis cirurgus, uxorem<note xml:id="fn34" type="footnote" n="34">Unbekannt.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>duxit <placeName ref="l361">Norinbergę</placeName>, licet hic sit natus.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Scripsi et germanice <lb xml:id="p2z26"/><persName ref="p4851">Christofero Froschovero</persName><note xml:id="fn35" type="footnote" n="35">Nicht erhalten.</note>, ut litteras vobis reddat.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Parce, pręcor, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>ruditati meę.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te pii tum ex <placeName ref="l2449">Bohemia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l449">Slesia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>et <placeName ref="l3291">Lusatia</placeName> fratres.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Valde petimus nos adnumerari vestris <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>fratribus.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Orate deum pro nobis.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo Iesu, <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>omnium salvatore, cum omnibus ecclesiis vestris.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z31"/>Datum <placeName ref="l580">Zittę</placeName>, 12. die mensis martii anno etc. 1538.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z32"/>Tuus in domino <persName ref="p2448">Osvaldus Pergenerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>scriba etc., et fratrum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z34"/>Dom<lb xml:id="p2z35"/>ino <lb xml:id="p2z36"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bul[lingero</persName>, apud <placeName ref="l587">Tig]urum</placeName><note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Textverlust, entstanden beim Öffnen des Briefes.</hi></note> ec<lb xml:id="p2z37"/>clesiaste [observando et]<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Textverlust, entstanden beim Öffnen des Briefes.</hi></note> charissimo fratri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
